  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "RUT 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi uninazala wathi kuye: Mntanami, ngingakudingeli umuntu yini ongakuthatha ukuba uhlale kuhle laye na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nango uBowasi isihlobo sethu obusebenza lamantombazana akhe. Uyabhula ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lakhe ngalobubusuku esizeni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geza ugcobe, ucece ngezigqoko zakho ezinhle, uye khona esizeni; kodwa ungazivezi kuye aze aqede ukudla lokunatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kuthi lapho eselala, uqaphelise indawo alala kiyo, ungene, ubususambula inyawo zakhe, ulale phansi, yena uzakukutshela ofanele ukwenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URuthe wasesithi: Konke okutshoyo ngizakukwenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesiya khona esizeni, wenza njengokutshelwa kwakhe nguninazala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uBowasi esedlile wanatha, waba lomdlozela, wasuka wayalala phansi ekucineni kwenqumbi yamabele. URuthe wasenyenya, wambula inyawo zakhe, walala phansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phakathi kobusuku uBowasi wethuka, waphenduka, wabona owesifazana elele ngasenyaweni zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: Ungubani wena? Yena waphendula wathi: NginguRuthe incekukazi yakho; yembesa incekukazi yakho ngengubo yakho, ngoba wena uyisihlobo sethu esiseduze kithi, ufanele ukungilondoloza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: INkosi ikubusise, mntanami, ngoba usuwenze lumusa wakho ube mkhulu kulowokuqala, kawuyanga ensizweni ezingabayanga loba ezinothileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho, mntanami, ungesabi, ngizakukwenzela okucelayo, ngoba bonke abantu bomuzi wakithi bayazi ukuthi ungowesifazana oqotho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yebo, kuliqiniso ukuba ngiyisihlobo esiseduze, kanti kukhona isihlobo esiseduze kakhulu kulami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruthe 2:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hlala lapha lobubusuku; kuzakuthi ekuseni uba yena ethanda ukungena esikhundleni sesihlobo esiseduze, kulungile; kodwa uba engathandi, ngizakukwenza lokho mina, ngifunga iNkosi. Lalake kuze kuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URuthe walala ngasezinyaweni zakhe kwaze kwasa, wavuka ekuseni abantu bengakabonani; uBowasi wathi: Kakungaziwa muntu ukuba owesifazana ufikile lapha esizeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Letha ingubo leyo oyembetheyo, uyendlale. URuthe waseyendlala. Yena wasemthelela ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " elingamagokoko amathathu, wasemethwesa yona; uRuthe wabuyela ekhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esefikile kuninazala, yena wathi: Uqhube njani, mntanami? URuthe wasemtshela konke lowomuntu ayemenzele khona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi: UBowasi unginike lamagokoko amathathu ebhali, ngoba wathi: Ungabuyeli kunyokozala ungelalutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi waphendula wathi: Hlala, mntanami, uze wazi ukuba lindaba izaphetha ngani, ngoba lowomuntu kayikuphumula, engakayilungisi indaba lamhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
